---
description: Resolve the actual bridge-delivery goal through semantic composition and exact native authorities.
args:
  goal: string
returns: BridgeResult | null
---
Resolve the actual local delivery, comparison or private handoff objective across the owned branch, live bridge and semantic workspace-file codebases. Retained remote observations, current upstream state, working/committed file identity and protected main are distinct. Select evidence needed for the requested claims and conditions; do not force every file review for an unrelated question.

Use real current native operation bindings and feedback. A local commit is separate from fetch, push, integration or publication; perform only the user-authorized effect. Preserve protected main and unrelated files, and do not infer authority from a historical successful observation. A requested private handoff needs actual supported findings and real retained bytes. Return domain findings and authentic effects; keep unavailable/uninspected evidence honest.

An initial inquiry has no previous value. When revisiting the private inquiry after real feedback, pass its actual prior result so historical source observations survive; do not substitute a new snapshot for the original merely because it is newer.
